    <string name="help_faq_q1">How do I add a new item?</string>
    <string name="help_faq_a1">Tap the add (+) button on the bottom bar, fill in the item name, category, and expiry date, then save.</string>
    <string name="help_faq_q2">When will I get expiry reminders?</string>
    <string name="help_faq_a2">Tickr sends reminders 7 days, 3 days, and 1 day before an item expires, and again on the expiry day at 8:00 AM. Make sure notifications are allowed in your device settings.</string>
    <string name="help_faq_q3">Is my data safe?</string>
    <string name="help_faq_a3">All data stays on your device and is never sent to any server. If you delete the app, your data is deleted too unless you have a backup. Save one from Settings, Export data.</string>
